====== NETGEAR R7800 (Nighthawk X4S AC2600) ======

Netgear R7800 is a dual-core 1.7 GHz AC2600 router based on IPQ8065 SoC and QCA9984 wifi.
 
Router has 512 MB RAM and 128 MB flash (about 80 MB free flash space after installation in 18.06 and later).

